- **Tool use: 82/100.** Evidence Terminal-Bench ~75%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 82/100.** Evidence GPQA ~80%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 200K — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 60/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 82/100.** Evidence SWE-bench Pro ~58%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 55/100.** Paid $3/$15 per 1M (200K).
- **Overall Score: 75/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (82+82+70+60+82)/5=75.2 → 75; best-fit per scoring methodology.

